# Store submission

When the conversation is about shipping, listing, screenshots, review, TestFlight, Play Console, or store rejection errors, **read the matching guide before answering**:

| Topic | Doc |
| --- | --- |
| **iOS / App Store Connect / Apple review** | [`docs/APP_STORE.md`](docs/APP_STORE.md) |
| **Android / Google Play** | [`docs/GOOGLE_PLAY.md`](docs/GOOGLE_PLAY.md) |

## Hard rules

1. **Owner has no iPhone.** Never assume a personal iPhone, TestFlight-on-their-phone, or “buy an iPhone.” Screenshots = exact pixel sizes (agent-exported from web UI, or Simulator on a Mac if available). See `docs/APP_STORE.md`.
2. **App Store Connect accepts PNG.** Failed uploads are almost always **wrong dimensions**, not the extension. Do not invent “convert to JPG.”
3. Play feature graphics in `assets/store/` are **Play-only**.
4. Do not invent Apple/Google account steps as if the agent completed them.
5. Health wording: exercise companion — not diagnose / treat / medical device.
